{"bug_description": "The mux that selects the partial remainder after subtract uses inverted control: it keeps the old remainder when the subtract succeeds (CO==1) and takes the subtract result when it fails, reversing non-restoring division updates. One swapped conditional on mux_result.", "buggy_rtl": "`timescale 1ns/1ps

module radix2_div(
