{"bug_description": "Unreachable State: CAL is part of the intended sequencing, but no transition ever enters CAL from SEEK, so CAL can never be observed during normal operation while downstream still expects calibration metadata to be marked valid.", "buggy_rtl": "module rom_loader_seq (
  input  wire       clk,
  input  wire       rst_n,
  input  wire       kick,
  input  wire       rom_rdy,
