{"bug_description": "Duplicate Encoding: ST_MAP and ST_RUN share the same numeric state code, so the second case branch is never selected as a distinct control point. Pulse shaping that should only occur in the run phase is incorrectly merged with the mapping phase behavior.", "buggy_rtl": "module edge_pwm_align (
