{"bug_description": "Static deadlock: a control state waits on a handshake predicate that can never become true under any finite sequence of primary inputs once the state is entered. The completion flag is defined in terms of a response that the interface only offers after the pending request is retired, but the arbiter never retires the request while awaiting that same flag.", "buggy_rtl": "module dma_tick_sequencer (
  input  wire        clk,
  input  wire        rst_n,
