{"bug_description": "Livelock: under sustained dual-channel pressure the arbiter ping-pongs between defer and retry without ever asserting the settlement latch. The sequence of states remains active, so it is not a static deadlock, but no forward progress toward the granted phase occurs for an unbounded period.", "buggy_rtl": "module arq_retry_scheduler (
  input  wire       clk,
  input  wire       rst_n,
  input  wire       ch_a,
