- core/cache_subsystem/cva6_hpdcache_if_adapter.sv

Signed-off-by: André Sintzoff <andre.sintzoff@thalesgroup.com>

- Verible formatting of the HPdcache/AXI adapter module: parameter and port lists re-indented and wrapped; no protocol semantic change (same note as bulk `verible-verilog-format` on core).", "buggy_rtl": "// Copyright 2023 Commissariat a l'Energie Atomique et aux Energies
